#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:10
msgid "Modbus RTU and TCP composition"
msgstr "Modbus RTU 与 TCP 装配"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:12
msgid ""
"The application selects the settled byte transport, storage, addresses, "
"protocol register policy and executor. The reusable RTU mechanism does not "
"own a product register map or a hidden worker."
msgstr "应用选择已结清的字节传输、存储、地址、协议寄存器策略及执行器。可复用 RTU 机制不拥有产品寄存器映射，也不创建隐式工作线程。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:16
msgid ""
"`Nexus::ModbusTCP` instead selects one connection's MBAP/PDU byte-session "
"boundary, reusing the same product-owned holding-register callbacks. It "
"supports functions 03, 06 and 16. A complete request borrows a stable "
"response until explicit release; a slow sender must retain unconsumed "
"pipeline bytes, and must not re-execute the write while the response is "
"pending."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::ModbusTCP` 选择一条连接的 MBAP／PDU 字节会话边界，复用同一组产品拥有的 holding-register "
"callback，支持功能 03、06 和 16。完整请求产生的稳定 response 借用到显式 "
"release；慢发送方必须保留尚未消费的流水线字节，response 仍 pending 时不得再次执行写入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:22
msgid ""
"The connection owner supplies TCP transport, finite deadlines, storage "
"limits and close policy. Malformed MBAP closes parser admission; it does not"
" search arbitrary payload for a new header. Register callbacks run in the "
"same serialized task. Product write authorization and atomic update rules "
"remain required; Modbus/TCP itself does not authenticate a peer. See the "
"[selected session contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/protocols/modbus_tcp/README.md). Neither "
"profile establishes physical serial timing or network HIL; those remain "
"`not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"连接 owner 提供 TCP transport、有限 deadline、存储上限和关闭策略。畸形 MBAP 关闭 parser 准入，不在任意 "
"payload 中搜索新 header。register callback 在同一串行 task "
"执行。产品仍须提供写授权和原子更新规则；Modbus／TCP 本身不认证 "
"peer。见[选定会话合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/modbus_tcp/README.md)。两个 profile 都不建立物理串口时序或网络 "
"HIL 资格，相应状态保持 `not_executed`。"

