#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "Initialize an unused, quiescent session."
msgstr "初始化未使用且没有在途调用的会话。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid ""
"Task-only serialized calls; no I/O or allocation. TCP is unauthenticated: "
"product callbacks own authorization."
msgstr "仅 task 上下文串行调用；不执行 I/O 或分配。TCP 不认证 peer，授权由产品 callback 负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[out] Caller storage, private after success."
msgstr "[out] 调用者存储，成功后为私有状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[in] Bounded callbacks, copied; context stays live."
msgstr "[in] 复制的有界 callback；其 context 持续存活。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[in] Exact accepted unit identity, 1..247; no broadcast."
msgstr "[in] 精确接纳的 unit 身份，1..247；无广播。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；失败保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "Consume bytes through at most one complete MBAP request."
msgstr "消费字节，至多处理一个完整 MBAP 请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid ""
"No socket I/O, deadline or retained input. Caller advances socket with its "
"finite deadline. Pending response blocks the next request, so writes are "
"never executed twice while a response is backpressured. Bad framing requires"
" closing the connection; do not search arbitrary payload for MBAP."
msgstr ""
"不执行 socket I/O，不持有 deadline，也不保留输入。调用者以自己的有限 deadline 推进 socket。pending "
"response 阻止下一请求，确保 response 背压期间不会重复执行写入。分帧错误须关闭连接，不在任意 payload 中搜索 MBAP。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[inout] Initialized, serialized session."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且串行管理的会话。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[in] Readable bytes, not retained; NULL only for zero size."
msgstr "[in] 不保留的可读字节；仅 size 为零时允许 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[in] Available bytes, may include another request."
msgstr "[in] 可用字节，可能包含另一请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[out] Distinct count; zero on admission failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立计数；准入失败时为零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after response production, BUSY for partial/pending, INVALID for "
"malformed MBAP (sticky failed session)."
msgstr ""
"产生 response 后返回 SUCCESS，partial／pending 返回 BUSY，畸形 MBAP 返回 INVALID（会话锁存失败）。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "Borrow the complete response until exact release."
msgstr "借用完整 response，直到精确 release。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "Transport must copy or settle its borrow before release."
msgstr "transport 必须在 release 前完成复制或结清其借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[in] Initialized serialized session."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且串行管理的会话。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[out] Distinct pointer into stable session TX storage."
msgstr "[out] 指向会话稳定 TX 存储的独立指针输出。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[out] Distinct number of response bytes."
msgstr "[out] 独立的 response 字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, INVALID or STATE; failure leaves outputs."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、INVALID 或 STATE；失败保持输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "Release a fully copied/settled response for next request."
msgstr "释放已完整复制／结清的 response，允许下一请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid ""
"Product closes admission and joins socket operations before reclaiming or "
"reinitializing session storage."
msgstr "回收或重新初始化会话存储前，产品关闭准入并 join socket 操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "[inout] Serialized session, all response borrowers joined."
msgstr "[inout] 串行会话，所有 response 借用者均已退出会合。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, INVALID or STATE; does not close a socket."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、INVALID 或 STATE；不关闭 socket。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:41
msgid "One serialized session; no socket, global map or worker."
msgstr "一个串行会话；无 socket、全局映射或 worker。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:45
msgid "modbus_registers.h"
msgstr "modbus_registers.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/modbus.md:47
msgid "Shared bounded Modbus register and authorization contract."
msgstr "共享的有界 Modbus 寄存器与授权合同。"
